e to start!\nNow let’s find the best place to start!\nStart from scratch\nTake the easiest lesson of the Spanish course\nFind my level\nLet Duo recommend where you should start learning\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":9,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"It can be hard to stay motivated…\nIt can be hard to stay motivated…\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":10,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"…so Duolingo is designed to be fun like a game!\n…so Duolingo is designed to be fun like a game!\nCONTINUE"},{"stage":11,"selected_group":null,"visible_text":"5\nNEW WORD\nWhich one of these is “cat”?\nagua\n1\ngato\n2\nmamá\n3\nSKIP\nCHECK\nLOADING...\nOur mission is to develop the best education in the world and make it universally available."}],"preparation":[{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “cat”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “dog”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “water”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “milk”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"matching","prompt":"Select the matching pairs","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “mom”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Which one of these is “dad”?","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"choice","prompt":"Select the correct meaning","feedback":"positive"},{"kind":"matching","prompt":"Select the matching pairs","feedback":"positive"},{"stage":"post-lesson-streak","visible_text":"day streak\nSa\nSu\nM\nTu\nW\nPracticing daily grows your streak, but skipping a day resets it!\nI CAN DO IT!","selection":"7 day streak Good"}],"url":"https://www.duolingo.com/lesson","visible_text":"Let’s commit to learning with a Streak Goal!\nLet’s commi